title: "Mira's Ant: every start of Langton's ant in a 6 by 6 box"
abstract: "Langton's ant run exactly from all 68,719,476,736 starting pictures in a 6 by 6 box around it: every one proven to build the 104-step highway. With how the road is entered: one main door walked by about one start in six, a stumble in one in five, false roads, and a right lean in which way the road leaves."
